            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> The first one is the culprit in this case, as nvim_buf_delete() is executed inside a callback (H.track_dir_edit) for BufEnter function.\r\n\r\nInitially I worried that `nested` would be propagated to the code in `MiniFiles.open` causing side-effects. I missed that in `H.track_dir_edit` it is `MiniFiles.open` itself that is scheduled. Thanks! ",
